nded":false,"created_at":1786313669,"updated_at":1786313669,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"战斗的感觉很差","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"The controls are a little clunky at first","review_id":"232168420","observation_id":"eac5b6eb040b7c9ef45e6773","description":"控制一开始有些笨拙","object":"controls","symptom":"clunky_controls","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":true,"created_at":1785993056,"updated_at":1785993056,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"操作一开始有点笨拙","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"Control and gameplay atrocious.","review_id":"232146751","observation_id":"2efb014b5633e57d8afdc326","description":"操控糟糕","object":"controls","symptom":"controls_poor","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":false,"created_at":1785964911,"updated_at":1785964946,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"操控和玩法糟糕透顶。","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"selecting/using items is clunky as hell","review_id":"232103156","observation_id":"00059a3e1c255df77f378bc7","description":"选择和使用的操作非常笨拙","object":"item_selection_usage","symptom":"clunky_controls","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":false,"created_at":1785919512,"updated_at":1785919512,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"选择/使用物品笨重得要命","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"宇宙船の操作はX4より最悪だし","review_id":"229144447","observation_id":"07c42546965ec8300c998999","description":"飞船操作比X4还糟糕","object":"spaceship_controls","symptom":"difficult_controls","claim":"complaint","language":"japanese","recommended":true,"created_at":1782733198,"updated_at":1783074111,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"宇宙船的操作比X4还糟糕","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"the stuff dealing with controlling the ship is wildly frustrating","review_id":"227899958","observation_id":"f8168146ebe5b2a2bedaea20","description":"控制飞船的部分令人沮丧","object":"ship_controls","symptom":"frustrating","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":false,"created_at":1781384521,"updated_at":1781384521,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"那些涉及操控飞船的内容极其令人沮丧","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"my ship is sliding all over the place","review_id":"225990411","observation_id":"98ea23517e81041543a4cd79","description":"飞船操控打滑，难以保持方向","object":"ship","symptom":"sliding_controls","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":false,"created_at":1779282066,"updated_at":1779282066,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"这是我在电子游戏里见过的最烂的太空旅行操控，我的飞船到处乱滑，而且你还得手动对接飞船，大概从第三次开始就变得极其烦人。\n\n据我所知，你的飞船没有自动驾驶，希望有带自动驾驶的高端飞船，但从这游戏给人的感觉来看，我觉得不太可能。\n\n另外，你可以接“零工”，大概就是有偿任务，但你得自己搞清楚该去哪里。没有指南针，没有任务标记，只有一个距离，这意味着你得自己弄明白该往哪个方向走，这本来也不算世界末日，前提是你不是一直像个白痴一样滑来滑去。当你没法保持静止、只能朝一个方向移动时，真的很难搞清楚该往哪里走。\n\n而且如果你在太空旅行时点击地图，你的地图会以你点击的任何东西为中心，哪怕是空无一物的太空。但由于“真实的太空物理”，那个太空中的点是在移动的。或者按我的理解，是你相对于它在移动。哪怕你完全静止不动。这不好玩。这没有用。这只是现实主义拉低了玩游戏的体验。这意味着每次你不小心点到空无一物的太空，你都得暂停游戏，一点一点、痛苦地点击拖拽回到你的飞船（同时还要对抗自动居中机制），然后点击它才能重新聚焦到它上面。\n\n这是那种大概要花你几天、甚至几周才能完全学会的游戏之一，但学习怎么玩这游戏一点都不好玩，既繁琐又无聊。我没有意志力去熬过这个学习曲线，指望这游戏也许能变好，好让我忽略这游戏基本上就是围绕着的糟糕太空旅行系统。\n\n3/10","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"the movement is very clunky, interrupting any game flow","review_id":"225303531","observation_id":"b5d1572a3f8df4038bb0fb96","description":"移动非常笨拙，打断游戏流程","object":"movement","symptom":"clunky_movement","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":false,"created_at":1778537137,"updated_at":1778537137,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"移动非常笨拙，打断了任何游戏流程","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"awful controls","review_id":"224992699","observation_id":"429ba7c182b17e72ad801273","description":"操作糟糕，难以适应","object":"game","symptom":"controls_unintuitive","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":false,"created_at":1778190534,"updated_at":1778190645,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"糟糕的操作","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"Корявое управление","review_id":"224003172","observation_id":"950b62c96d0a063d8bf80f12","description":"操作别扭","object":"controls","symptom":"clunky_controls","claim":"complaint","language":"russian","recommended":true,"created_at":1777059808,"updated_at":1777059885,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"操作别扭","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"finicky controls","review_id":"221612670","observation_id":"02bb231598ae597d7838bfe2","description":"控制很挑剔","object":"game","symptom":"finicky_controls","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":false,"created_at":1774387972,"updated_at":1774387972,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"操作很挑剔","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"clunky controls","review_id":"220758393","observation_id":"74732d421b937ef087991857","description":"操作笨重不流畅","object":"controls","symptom":"clunky_controls","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":true,"created_at":1773594289,"updated_at":1773594289,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"操作笨拙","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"a thick veneer of clunky control","review_id":"219845740","observation_id":"90b367aa1e573ee30091d624","description":"操作笨拙不流畅","object":"controls","symptom":"clunky_controls","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":true,"created_at":1772673377,"updated_at":1772673377,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"一层厚厚的笨拙操作感","translation_status":"ready"},{"quote":"controls and ui are a bit clunky","review_id":"218466796","observation_id":"5ad1894e141f189446c201e3","description":"操作有些笨拙","object":"controls","symptom":"clunky_controls","claim":"complaint","language":"english","recommended":true,"created_at":1771254071,"updated_at":1771254071,"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","quote_zh":"操作和界面有点笨拙","translat